  "content": "<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/SubTerra_Tech/BH_SubTerra_Tech_header.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"450\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252finvxrt.github.io%252fbisect%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/SubTerra_Tech/BH_SubTerra_Tech_promo2.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"250\"></a></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/SubTerra_Tech/BH_SubTerra_Tech_description.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>你将从鹅卵石和一棵树开始，通过自定义配方制作安山岩，然后使用 Create 模组和匠魂模组来制作“资源核心”，以生成启动其他模组进展所需的所有材料。</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>本整合包将带你从 Create 模组，到 Ars Nouveau（新魔法）与 Blood Magic（血魔法），再到 Thermal（热力系列）与 Industrial Foregoing（工业前置），接着是 Botania（植物魔法），最后是 Mekanism（通用机械）以及 ExtendedCrafting（扩展合成），用于获取创意物品和 elusive 的完成奖杯！</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/SubTerra_Tech/BH_SubTerra_Tech_features.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></p>\n<ul>\n<li>超过 650 个任务！</li>\n<li>自动化</li>\n<li>自定义配方</li>\n<li>自定义物品</li>\n<li>体验诸如：Create、Blood Magic、Ars Nouveau、Thermal、Industrial Foregoing、Mekanism 和 ExtendedCrafting 等模组！</li>\n<li style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><span style=\"color:#e03e2d\"><strong>对于服务器，请确保将 level-type 设置为 skyblockbuilder:skyblock</strong></span></li>\n</ul>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/sm7YwM57cR\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/images/CF/SubTerra_Tech/BH_SubTerra_Tech_discord.webp\" width=\"1400\" height=\"150\"></a></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe style=\"width:524px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/YfBsKa157q8\" width=\"524\" height=\"309\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/84YyZfiEcgg\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/dkh0C9xMYt8\" width=\"560\" height=\"314\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
